# Feature Library Reference

This rule provides context for using the modular features of the ReFi template.

## Available UI Elements (Grids & Sections)
Refer to `docs/LIBRARY.md` and `docs/ELEMENTS-CATALOG.md` for full documentation.

- **Buttons**: `.cta-button`
- **Sections**: `.section-container`, `.section-container-tinted`, `.section-content-centered`
- **Grids**: `.two-col-grid`, `.three-col-grid`, `.grid-item`

## Styling Patterns
All elements follow the canonical CSS variable system:
- `--accent-dark`: Primary brand color
- `--accent-medium`: Secondary brand color
- `--accent-light`: Light accent/background
- `--accent-highlight`: Subtlest tint (for sections)

## Modular Packages
- **Analytics**: Configured in `quartz.config.ts`.
- **Comments**: Configured in `quartz.layout.ts` (Giscus).
- **Multilang**: Build with `npm run build:multilang`.
- **OG Images**: Automatic generation (slows builds).


